==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{proto|Indo-European|wōkʷs|speech, voice|lang=la}}. Cognates include {{etyl|sa|-}} {{term|sc=Deva|वाच्|tr=vā́c|lang=sa}} and {{etyl|grc|-}} {{term|sc=polytonic|ὄψ|tr=óps|lang=grc}}. {{proto|Indo-European|wōkʷ-|lang=}} is an [[o-grade]] of {{proto|Indo-European|wekʷ-|title=|lang=}} whence {{etyl|grc|-}} {{term|ἔπος|tr=épos|lang=grc}}.

